WEBVTT

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:30.160
"You're at Yale now. You don't have to
do that anymore," she said.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:34.176
I figured, this was just one
of the small prices

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.240
that must be paid to make it.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:40.176
I paid them all, or tried,

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.936
and sure enough
they seemed to pay me back:

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.296
made me a leader
on the varsity football team;

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.736
got me into a not-so-secret society

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.296
and a job on Wall Street,
and later in Washington.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.976
Things were going so well
that I figured naturally

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.376
I should be President
of the United States.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:00.576
(Laughter)